<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  1.27%			 O/N = Par</p>
<p>	    T/N =  1.27%			 T/N = Par</p>
<p>		   Dec  11, 1996			Dec  10, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.77%	1 month forward =  5.77%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.28%	2 month forward =  6.45%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.68%	3 month forward =  6.67%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.13%	4 month forward =  7.29%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.26%	5 month forward =  7.53%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.08%	6 month forward =  7.41%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
